\ Fixture for own_module_image_scan_serialized, image-serialized via `use`.
\ Exports a `probe` colliding with own_module_image_scan_serialized_a's. Its
\ module name sorts second, so the residual module-cache scan must never
\ answer with this export. `b-tag` calls `probe` so the colliding body is
\ reachable from the entry and compiles with this module's identity.

probe: ( -- str ) [ "B-PROBE" ] ;

b-tag: ( -- str ) [ probe ] ;
